ere that invariant is established, and why the proposed change fixes the violation without bypassing the framework's normal lifecycle. Do not edit until the contract, scope map, and failure-path trace are mutually consistent. Before implementation, create or identify the smallest deterministic reproduction of the reported behavior, preferably using the repository's existing test harness, and record the command and expected failure. Define a focused regression test that fails before the patch and captures the behavioral contract without overfitting to implementation details.
